{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22922","headline":"江南谪居十韵 · 白居易","name":"江南谪居十韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自哂沈冥客，曾爲献纳臣。\n壮心徒许国，薄命不如人。\n才展凌云翅，俄成失水鳞。\n葵枯犹向日，蓬断即辞春。\n泽畔长愁地，天边欲老身。\n萧条残活计，冷落旧交亲。\n草合门无径，烟消甑有尘。\n忧方知酒圣，贫始觉钱神。\n虎尾难容足，羊肠易覆轮。\n行藏与通塞，一切任陶钧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22922.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22922","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}